  "carter-joseph": { name: "Carter Joseph", role: "Honorary Member", photo: "",
    bio: `A longtime opera lover and board member, Carter Joseph started Opera 101, a free introduction to each Atlanta Opera production, in 1985, and has also taught the Evening at Emory class series. He gives talks on each opera’s history and composer an hour before curtain.

He studied art at the University of Georgia, hoping to become a painter, until a trip to Europe sparked his love of opera. Mozart is his favorite composer.` },
